`LiftingAt (Fin d × Multiplicative (ZMod 2)) (freeOperatorGenPerm d (ofAdd 1)) i j` (`1 ≤ j ≤ i`),
through `LiftingAux.freeGroup_refinedTerm_lifting_of_modelRange` (proved here from the proved
