* Norm statements are proved by induction on `k` for all `N ⊇ P_k`
  (`LiftingAux.normStatement_of_pCentralSeries_le`), the step being
  `Work.SSGRoute.central_descent_antifixed_weak` with central subgroup the image of `P_k`.
